<br>Exquisite Corpse</TD> 
</TR> 
</TABLE> </p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uschnappfoo.showPublicProfile?language=EN>schnappfoo</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/14/01 2:00:50 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=54.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: TOFS 7</span><hr size=1> its a good map.  ive never zoned in from floor 6, ive always zoned in from lvl 1 with the key off tserrina. but when you use the key off tserrina you zone in the the room with the mirrors, not the room with the single spawn... i could be wrong, maybe if you zone in from 6 you do go to that room and the mirror room is the end...  <br>
and its true about the bats, like on floor 6 if you kill all the bats you get things to spawn, the efretti on 6b and tserrina on 7.  <br>
<br>
inotuu<br>
<br>
ps. do we have any guild mages yet? <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uschnappfoo.showPublicProfile?language=EN>schnappfoo</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/14/01 2:15:27 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=54.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: TOFS 7</span><hr size=1> oh yah, some other fun stuff.<br>
<br>
tserrina. cons white to me at 51 (my mage) so that means she has all the fun things like summoning and gating. 100% magic resistant and she charms.  so this means lots of tanks and lots of healers.  <br>
<br>
6th floor was pretty easy compared to 7th i thought, i could solo the bats and vampires on 6b and the efretti wasnt taht though for us, but tserrina waxed us once. let me explain.<br>
<br>
first, kill all the extra guys you can, when we pulled her the first time she brought 2 imps and a torch, not a good thing.  our clerics would heal then have the adds on them. so they died. then we all died. luckily there was one necro with coffins taht gated out (so we got the cleric with the keys)<br>
<br>
second time we had all the necros mages and wizards take care of the adds.  then tserrina wasnt much of a problem. she still wasnt easy though.  <br>
<br>
she has some good loot, the mage only gem is nice (i have one =) )  she has a whip, robe, neck item and keys.  its a fun raid all around though. <br>
<br>
inotuu <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/14/01 4:23:58 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=54.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> 7th floor</span><hr size=1> Thanks for the helpful information.  Would like to get a 7th floor raid hapening soon.<br>
<br>
*Tressia <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uzilben.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Zilben</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/15/01 10:46:06 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=54.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Burn the WITCH!!</span><hr size=1> ok, this is the info I have gathered about Tserrina on floor 7. This should prove useful on a future raid or attack on her...<br>
<br>
1) Tserrina has a chance at spawning from 1 of the bats on floor 7 every 40 min. There are several ways to tell if the bat you've found will pop Tserrina. Supposedly, Tserrina will pop from the only bats you find that con green to a lvl 51. Also, if the group pulls a bat, and pets will NOT respond to the /pet attack command on it...that bat will spawn Tserrina. Your pets will only attack if the bat attacks you.<br>
<br>
2) She is level 51 always. She is almost 100% magic resistent. Wizard Lure spells WILL land from what I hear. Also she lacks in the Fire Resistence aspect. So expect some spells landed in that department. And remember, with the success rate of spells landing...level is everything. Get as high as you can to 51 or above before taking her on if you expect to land any spells. We will require a dedicated tank or two also with cleric healing as much as possible. CH if available.<br>
hehe, methinks Chumb would be a welcome addition for this fight. (also casters, let tanks deal a good chunk of damage before nuking, aggro'ing Tserrina will get you killed in 3 seconds)<br>
<br>
3) She drops a key which will instantly port you to floor 7, for more Tserrina killing fun later without walking the entire way. You do need the keys from the other floors for this to work though.(not sure what mirror to use this key on)<br>
<br>
4) Consensus is she is a necromancer because she has nasty fear spells as well as charm spells (VampireCharm). She has a tendancy to charm any pets she sees to use for her demonic purposes. To combat this you need an enchanter to charm it back and kill it. Be wary, she also charms people, so a caster that gets charmed must be dealt with or be prepared to be chain nuked. (I have not dealt with mega-charming mobs before so I do not know how PC charms are dealt with personally)<br>
<br>
5) Hits for up to 220 and has tons of hp. Nuff said.<br>
<br>
